{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず私服のせるかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/2393515/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日お洋服はお母さんスタイリストです!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんたもさゆにゃんみたいなフリフリたまには着なさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言うことでさゆにゃんみたいなフリフリです!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"珍しいやろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもメンバーやみなさんからはかわいいや似合ってる等々の声を頂いたので嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにこの帽子はいこまのお気に入り！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うふふ〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして来てくださったみなさん!!ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりや初めまして!!の方、いつも来てくださってくれるみなさんとお話できて楽しかったです!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がしかし..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこま季節の変わり目のアレルギー性鼻炎のため、鼻水やら咳やらこいてしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お見苦しい所をお見せしてすいませんでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/2393515/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でももう少したったら体がなれるから治ると思われます!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてみなさんから沢山の元気をもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまは大丈夫だから！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/2393515/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってこんなに沢山の味方がついてるから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからいこまは実力を、全てを上げられるように前に進みます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日これなかった皆様。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会える時は沢山あるからねいこま待ってるからね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/2393515/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん!!本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また１０月に会いましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/2393515/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"}